  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EDUCA TV PHASE 4, YEAR 4</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educa TV - improve STEM teaching and learning through the structured use of audio-visual materials - OSUWELA programme in 2025 program have two components, the Educa-TV and World robotic Olympiad (WRO).Target group are STEM teachers and students from Grades 7&#x2013;12. Key objectives of the programme includes Integrating existing audiovisual material into teacher training as a core resource for distance education; Training teachers in digital methodologies and strategies for remote and hybrid teaching; Supporting the Ministry of Education in adopting, disseminating, and institutionalising these materials within the national education system; Ensuring broad access to content through an open online platform; and Promoting STEM engagement through the World Robotic Olympiad (WRO) in Mozambique.</narrative>
  </description>
